{"suttaId":"tha-ap43","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[3484,3557],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap43:0.3":"Bhāgineyyupālittheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap43:1.1":"“Khīṇāsavasahassehi, parivuto [pareto (ka. aṭṭha)] lokanāyako;","tha-ap43:1.3":"Vivekamanuyutto so, gacchate paṭisallituṃ.","tha-ap43:2.1":"“Ajinena nivatthohaṃ, tidaṇḍaparidhārako;","tha-ap43:2.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghaparibyūḷhaṃ, addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap43:3.1":"“Ekaṃsaṃ ajinaṃ katvā, sire katvāna añjaliṃ;","tha-ap43:3.3":"Sambuddhaṃ abhivādetvā, santhaviṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap43:4.1":"“Yathāṇḍajā ca saṃsedā, opapātī jalābujā;","tha-ap43:4.3":"Kākādipakkhino sabbe, antalikkhacarā sadā.","tha-ap43:5.1":"“Ye keci pāṇabhūtatthi, saññino vā asaññino;","tha-ap43:5.3":"Sabbe te tava ñāṇamhi, anto honti samogadhā.","tha-ap43:6.1":"“Gandhā ca pabbateyyā ye, himavantanaguttame;","tha-ap43:6.3":"Sabbe te tava sīlamhi, kalāyapi na yujjare.","tha-ap43:7.1":"“Mohandhakārapakkhando, ayaṃ loko sadevako;","tha-ap43:7.3":"Tava ñāṇamhi jotante, andhakārā vidhaṃsitā.","tha-ap43:8.1":"“Yathā atthaṅgate sūriye, honti sattā tamogatā;","tha-ap43:8.3":"Evaṃ buddhe anuppanne, hoti loko tamogato.","tha-ap43:9.1":"“Yathodayanto ādicco, vinodeti tamaṃ sadā;","tha-ap43:9.3":"Tatheva tvaṃ buddhaseṭṭha, viddhaṃsesi tamaṃ sadā.","tha-ap43:10.1":"“Padhānapahitattosi, buddho loke sadevake;","tha-ap43:10.3":"Tava kammābhiraddhena, tosesi janataṃ bahuṃ.","tha-ap43:11.1":"“Taṃ sabbaṃ anumoditvā, padumuttaro mahāmuni;","tha-ap43:11.3":"Nabhaṃ abbhuggamī dhīro, haṃsarājāva ambare.","tha-ap43:12.1":"“Abbhuggantvāna sambuddho, mahesi padumuttaro;","tha-ap43:12.3":"Antalikkhe ṭhito satthā, imā gāthā abhāsatha.","tha-ap43:13.1":"“Yenidaṃ thavitaṃ ñāṇaṃ, opammehi samāyutaṃ;","tha-ap43:13.3":"Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi, suṇātha mama bhāsato.","tha-ap43:14.1":"“‘Aṭṭhārasañca khattuṃ so, devarājā bhavissati;","tha-ap43:14.3":"Pathabyā rajjaṃ tisataṃ, vasudhaṃ āvasissati.","tha-ap43:15.1":"“‘Pañcavīsatikkhattuñca, cakkavattī bhavissati;","tha-ap43:15.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap43:16.1":"“‘Kappasatasahassamhi, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap43:16.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap43:17.1":"“‘Tusitā hi cavitvāna, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap43:17.3":"Hīnova jātiyā santo, upāli nāma hessati.","tha-ap43:18.1":"“‘So pacchā pabbajitvāna, virājetvāna pāpakaṃ;","tha-ap43:18.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya, nibbāyissatināsavo.","tha-ap43:19.1":"“‘Tuṭṭho ca gotamo buddho, sakyaputto mahāyaso;","tha-ap43:19.3":"Vinayādhigataṃ tassa, etadagge ṭhapessati’.","tha-ap43:20.1":"“Saddhāyāhaṃ pabbajito, katakicco anāsavo;","tha-ap43:20.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap43:21.1":"“Bhagavā cānukampī maṃ, vinayehaṃ visārado;","tha-ap43:21.3":"Sakakammābhiraddho ca, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap43:22.1":"“Saṃvuto pātimokkhamhi, indriyesu ca pañcasu;","tha-ap43:22.3":"Dhāremi vinayaṃ sabbaṃ, kevalaṃ ratanākaraṃ [ratanaggharaṃ (ka.)].","tha-ap43:23.1":"“Mamañca guṇamaññāya, satthā loke anuttaro;","tha-ap43:23.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ.","tha-ap43:24.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap43:24.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap43:25.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā upālithero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap43:26.1":"Bhāgineyyupālittherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2491,"to":2492,"paras":[{"para":2491,"vripara":"1","refs":["tha-ap43:1"],"lines":["So evaṃ etadaggaṭṭhānaṃ patvā attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>khīṇāsavasahassehī</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>ā</b> samantato yāvabhavaggā savanti pavattantīti āsavā.","Kāmāsavādayo cattāro āsavā, te khīṇā sositā visositā viddhaṃsitā yehi teti khīṇāsavā, teyeva sahassā khīṇāsavasahassā, tehi khīṇāsavasahassehi.","<b>Pareto</b> parivuto <b>lokanāyako</b> lokassa nibbānapāpanako vivekaṃ anuyutto paṭisallituṃ ekībhavituṃ gacchateti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap43:1"],["tha-ap43:1"],["tha-ap43:1"],["tha-ap43:1"]]},{"para":2492,"vripara":"2","refs":["tha-ap43:2"],"lines":["<b>Ajinena nivatthohan</b>ti ahaṃ ajinamigacammena paṭicchanno, ajinacammavasanoti attho.","<b>Tidaṇḍaparidhārako</b>ti kuṇḍikaṭṭhapanatthāya tidaṇḍaṃ gahetvā dhārentoti attho.","Bhikkhusaṅghena paribyūḷhaṃ parivāritaṃ lokanāyakaṃ addasanti sambandho.","Sesaṃ pākaṭamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap43:2"],["tha-ap43:2"],["tha-ap43:2"],["tha-ap43:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap43:1.1","khīṇāsavasahassehī",0,0],["tha-ap43:1.1","ā",0,1],["tha-ap43:1.3","ā",0,1],["tha-ap43:1.1","lokanāyako",0,3],["tha-ap43:2.1","ajinena nivatthohaṃ",1,0],["tha-ap43:2.1","tidaṇḍaparidhārako",1,1]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
